  "summary": "Refactors the functional test `mempool_reorg.py` to run against a single node instead of two. It replaces multi-node chain fork simulations with framework helpers `create_empty_fork` and `trigger_reorg`, eliminates redundant node synchronization and connection calls, removes global immediate transaction relay arguments, and splits the test flow into distinct test methods.",
